<title>HONG KONG: PT Impack Pratama Industri signs US$21 mln loan.</title>
<headline>PT Impack Pratama Industri signs US$21 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Impack Pratama Industri's US$21 million loan facility has been signed, arranger Sanwa Bank said.</p>
<p>The facility has a final maturity of one year.</p>
<p>All participants committed US$3 million each.</p>
<p>Sanwa Bank is the arranger. Bank LTCB Central Asia and Rabobank Duta Indonesia are co-arrangers.</p>
<p>Other participants are Banque Francaise du Commerce Exterieur Singapore, Banque Nationale de Paris Singapore, Dai-ichi Kangyo Bank Singapore and Societe Generale Indonesia.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
